  https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-powerquery (MIT License, Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation), and are used only by
  the check of the Power Query files (src/labtrack_bi/mlint.py and tools/check_m.cjs).

* src/labtrack_bi/resources/CY24SU10.json is the base theme that Power BI Desktop writes into every report it saves
  (it is Microsoft's file). This copy was taken from a report saved by Desktop in
  https://github.com/alisonpezzott/pbi_file_formats (MIT License, Copyright (c) 2025 Alison Pezzott). The report folder
  refers to it as BaseThemes/CY24SU10.json.

* tools/check_m.cjs uses @microsoft/powerquery-parser and @microsoft/powerquery-language-services (MIT License,
  Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation), installed with `npm install` in tools/; they are not part of this repository.

